(`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it\nneeds nothing from the home folder.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":6,"newStart":17,"newLines":10,"lines":[" Lanes:"," "," - `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.","+- `codex-sandbox`: the same Codex run, under the same macOS sandbox profile","+  and with a scratch HOME as `kimi`. `CODEX_HOME` points into the scratch HOME,","+  so Codex's state never touches the real home. `final.txt` is copied into the","+  run folder after the run."," - `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the","   macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real","   home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RP3fyn3Schma8Tzmks2kCr","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
